WEBVTT

00:46:58.596 --> 00:47:01.036
Ukrainian citizens being killed.

00:47:01.036 --> 00:47:03.796
It could reach tens of thousands,
hundreds of thousands.

00:47:04.476 --> 00:47:10.196
So in this sense, it's extremely
painful to contemplate.

00:47:10.916 --> 00:47:13.356
And this is why we need again and again

00:47:13.356 --> 00:47:18.436
to urge the leaders to stop this war,

00:47:18.436 --> 00:47:21.156
and especially, again and again,

00:47:21.196 --> 00:47:22.876
tell Putin,

00:47:22.916 --> 00:47:26.516
"You will not be able
to absorb Ukraine into Russia.

00:47:26.516 --> 00:47:29.396
They don't want it, they don't want you.

00:47:29.996 --> 00:47:31.596
If you continue,